{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o038b","title":"孙权遣梁寓贡汉令王惇市马遣朱光归","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o038b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权遣梁寓贡汉令王惇市马遣朱光归","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0018","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0019","role":"市马","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0050","role":"归还","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"定荆州后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o034","basis":"定荆州后"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o038b-q","wuzhu-q-o034","guanzhang-q-o008","guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o038b-q","source_order":[47,156,"O038b"],"order":8198},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p014a","title":"梁寓奉孙权命观曹操被辟掾后遣还","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p014a-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"梁寓奉孙权命观曹操被辟掾后遣还","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p014a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0018","role":"奉使受辟","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p014a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"辟遣","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p014a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p014a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙权遣梁寓观曹操时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p014a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-p014a-q","source_order":[47,185,"P014a"],"order":8199}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0018","name":"梁寓","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o038"],"facts":[{"id":"wuzhu-f0004","label":"字","text":"孔儒","evidence":["wuzhu-f0004-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"孔儒","evidence":["wuzhu-f0004-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o038-wuzhu-p0018","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o038"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p014-wuzhu-p0018","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p014"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p029-wuzhu-p0018","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p029"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o038b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8b56f94fb6258cb05737","layer":"original","quote":"权遣校尉梁寓，奉贡于汉；及令王惇市马〖25〗；又遣朱光等归。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":61},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p014a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-9521204ca1743b04b210","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“梁寓字孔儒。吴人也。权遣寓，观望曹公；曹公因以为掾，寻遣（南还）〔还南〕。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-867591d9c6d46ac718c8","start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-f0004-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-9521204ca1743b04b210","layer":"pei","quote":"梁寓字孔儒","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-867591d9c6d46ac718c8","start":10,"end":15},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o038","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8b56f94fb6258cb05737","layer":"original","quote":"曹公表权为骠骑将军〖23〗，假节〖24〗，领荆州牧，封南昌侯。权遣校尉梁寓，奉贡于汉；及令王惇市马〖25〗；又遣朱光等归。﹝二﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p014","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-9521204ca1743b04b210","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“梁寓字孔儒。吴人也。权遣寓，观望曹公；曹公因以为掾，寻遣（南还）〔还南〕。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-867591d9c6d46ac718c8","start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p029","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-5f9748512e57c63b0c08","layer":"pei","quote":"又曰：‘权本性空薄，文武不昭；昔承父兄成军之绪，得为先王所见奖饰；遂因国恩，抚绥东土。而中间寡虑，庶事不明；畏威忘德，以取重戾。先王恩仁，不忍遐弃；既释其宿罪，且开明信。虽致命虏廷，枭获关羽；功效浅薄，未报万一。事业未究，先王即世。殿下践阼，威仁流迈；私惧情愿，未蒙昭察。梁寓来到，具知殿下不遂疏远，必欲抚录，追本先绪。权之得此，欣然踊跃，心开目明，不胜其庆。权世受宠遇，分义深笃；今日之事，永执一心。惟察\"\"，重垂含覆。’","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-43467797fb37569f4074","start":0,"end":212}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
